12
00:00:40.070 --> 00:00:41.930
Oh my gosh, is that crazy?

13
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:42.330
Yeah.

14
00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:44.490
There's all these pictures of Kate on the hood of the car.

15
00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:47.530
All right, so I went back and re-watched this episode.

16
00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:49.270
Lady, it's so good.

17
00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.530
And when we first broke down the episode,

