It would have come right at the beginning after Michael tells the bullpen

21
00:01:01.030 --> 00:01:05.210
that he just hit Meredith with his car and Leslie David Baker nails it.

22
00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:05.870
Let's hear it.

23
00:01:06.550 --> 00:01:09.450
You ran over Meredith this morning in the parking lot.

24
00:01:09.490 --> 00:01:12.990
And saved her life, yes, by taking her to the hospital.

25
00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:15.230
They cut back the Christmas gift.

26
00:01:15.490 --> 00:01:17.290
Then no personal calls from work.

27
00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:18.830
Now we get run over.

28
00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:24.070
He's like, what's next?

29
00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:29.190
And there are also a lot of candy bag alts for all of these talking heads.

30
00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:32.290
Everyone's, of course, you know, reacting to the news about Meredith.

31
00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.090
I love these two from Creed.

32
