33
00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:36.010
Yes.

34
00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:37.650
Creed says, Meredith?

35
00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.710
Meredith died 20 years ago.

36
00:01:40.150 --> 00:01:41.230
The next one.

37
00:01:41.650 --> 00:01:43.430
Who the f*** is Meredith Palmer?

38
00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:52.780
Well, there's also a deleted Michael talking head that cracked me up because it's one of those

39
00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:56.860
