48
00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:15.460
Yeah.

49
00:02:15.460 --> 00:02:16.420
For all we know.

50
00:02:16.760 --> 00:02:21.140
Well, Jenna, you also did a great deep dive on rabies for this episode.

51
00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.940
And I wanted to add another nugget to your share.

52
00:02:24.200 --> 00:02:25.600
It comes from Adrienne E.

