56
00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:39.260
Two fishermen were trying to keep a rabid beaver out of their boat and both died from

57
00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.900
rabies from not so apparent cuts in the skin that we all have.

58
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:52.060
Oh, so if the saliva gets into an open wound or a cut or something, you can acquire rabies that way.

59
00:02:52.180 --> 00:02:53.120
Isn't that crazy?

60
00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:53.720
Yeah.

61
00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:57.120
Also, what the f**k with the rabid beaver?

