00:02:58.380 --> 00:03:00.840
I mean, that sounds so scary.

63
00:03:03.440 --> 00:03:04.000
Truly.

64
00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:06.720
I feel like that might have been about what she said.

65
00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:10.580
Sorry.

66
00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:13.180
Sorry, second drinks listeners.

67
00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:15.680
Oh, my goodness.

68
00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:19.340
I'm very proud of my rabies deep dive in this episode.

69
00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:24.100
Ange, I've gotten a lot of letters from people saying thank you that they've woken up with a bat

70
00:03:24.100 --> 00:03:26.320
in their room and they've known to go to the hospital.

71
00:03:26.720 --> 00:03:27.160
Yeah.

72
00:03:27.160 --> 00:03:32.500
I was shocked about how many people wrote in sharing similar stories or what they learned

73
00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:35.680
from your share and how that's helped them prevent things.

74
00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:36.040
Yeah.

75
