fast facts for this episode or for the job part one.

79
00:03:47.480 --> 00:03:50.480
And I guess in the episodes, I don't even address it.

80
00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:54.260
That's because we had the Paul Lieberstein interview at the top of show for job one.

81
00:03:54.260 --> 00:03:59.200
And we had the Kate Flannery interview for the top of show for fun run part one.

82
00:03:59.340 --> 00:04:01.660
You know, I saw those comments too, lady.

83
00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:06.080
And what cracked me up is because I think we normally explain or tell people what's up.

84
00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:06.480
Yeah.

