00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:20.220
And I also love, lady, how much people clearly connect with your fast facts and notice when

89
00:04:20.220 --> 00:04:20.860
they're not any.

90
00:04:21.060 --> 00:04:22.380
So maybe it's time to bring them back.

91
00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.820
To OfficeLady6.0.

92
00:04:25.400 --> 00:04:27.140
