00:04:33.000 --> 00:04:34.280
It's at the hospital.

96
00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:38.200
Michael asks everyone to go around and say something nice about Meredith.

97
00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:40.960
And what Kevin says cracked me up.

98
00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.380
