99
00:04:44.660 --> 00:04:45.900
It's just classic Kevin.

100
00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:46.640
Let's hear it.

101
00:04:47.020 --> 00:04:51.520
Why don't we go around the room and save one memory of Meredith?

102
00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:52.380
I'll start.

103
00:04:52.380 --> 00:04:53.860
I liked her jumpers.

104
00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:56.160
They reminded me of kindergarten.

105
00:05:00.260 --> 00:05:00.520
Jim?

106
