I'll always remember Meredith's back.

107
00:05:03.460 --> 00:05:05.580
That's all I can see from my desk.

108
00:05:05.980 --> 00:05:09.300
All that red hair over a nice strong back.

109
00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.940
Sometimes I pretend it's Carrot Top and he's going to turn around and tell a joke.

110
00:05:16.380 --> 00:05:19.840
Lady, it made me laugh out loud when I heard it.

111
00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.180
And I remember filming those scenes.

112
00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:22.480
Yeah.

113
00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:25.880
There's so much more that didn't make it in the original episode.

114
00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.000
But we were laughing so hard.

115
00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.020
We got so tickled.

116
00:05:30.200 --> 00:05:32.580
I remember I did that laugh where I was crying.

117
00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:35.740
And poor Kate had to lay there.

118
00:05:35.880 --> 00:05:36.240
Yes.

119
00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.000
With her eyes closed while we were breaking and having to start over.

120
00:05:40.220 --> 00:05:43.760
And oh my gosh, it was the type of laughing where it actually is painful

121
00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:46.680
