00:07:35.240 --> 00:07:39.200
Meanwhile, everyone wants to know if Jim and Pam are dating.

165
00:07:39.360 --> 00:07:40.440
They insist they're not.

166
00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:41.800
They say they're just friends.

167
00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.980
But Kevin is not convinced.

168
00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:47.020
Kevin really has a bee in his bonnet about it.

169
00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:48.020
Yeah.

170
00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:50.120
